Recommends: nvidia-cuda-toolkit
Description: GPU-accelerated voice-to-text for Ubuntu
 AutoWhisper converts speech to text using NVIDIA GPU acceleration.
 Press a hotkey, speak, release - text appears in any window.
 .
 Features:
  * Sub-200ms latency with GPU acceleration
  * Unified CLI: autowhisper start/stop/doctor/config
  * Hotkey triggered (push-to-talk or toggle)
  * Direct text injection to any window
  * 100% offline operation
 .
 Usage:
  * autowhisper doctor    - Check system compatibility
  * autowhisper start     - Start the service
  * autowhisper config    - View/edit configuration
